<title>USA: Cummins Engine sets $120 mln snr debentures.</title>
<headline>Cummins Engine sets $120 mln snr debentures.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Cummins Engine Co Inc was priced on Friday, according to lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER CUMMINS ENGINE CO INC</p>
<p>AMT $120 MLN	  COUPON 6.75 PCT   MATURITY 2/15/2027</p>
<p>TYPE SNR DEBENTURES ISS PRICE 99.697  FIRST PAY DATE 8/15/1997 LAST MOODY'S BAA1   YIELD 6.792 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-PLUS   SPREAD 50 BP/10-YR PUTABLE IN THE 10TH</p>
<p>							 YEAR</p>
<p>U.S. Corporate bond unit 212-859-1678</p>
